{"ref":"BDB, חצצר²","hw":"חצצר²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חצצר</span>]</big>  <strong>vb.</strong> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">[חצר]</span> Qr, denominat. from <span dir=\"rtl\">חצצרה</span> = <em>sound a clarion</em>—<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַצְּצ֯רִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.13\">2 Ch 5:13</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַצְּרִים</span>) = <em>players on clarions</em>.<br><strong>Hiph.</strong>  Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְצְצ֯רִים</span> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְצְרִים</span> as Hiph. v. Kö<sup>ii, 252</sup>) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a>; + 3 times + <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.12\">2 Ch 5:12</a> Baer, (van d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">מחצררים</span>); <em>sound with clarions</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">מח׳ בחצצרות</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.24\">1 Ch 15:24</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 5:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.5.12\">2 Ch 5:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 13:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.13.14\">13:14</a>; abs. <em>sounded</em> (<em>sounding</em>) <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 7:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.7.6\">2 Ch 7:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.28\">29:28</a>, cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חֲצֹצְרָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חֲצֹצְרָה\">חצצרה</a> <em>ad</em> fin. (Kt in all to be pronounced (prob.) <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחַצְצְרִים</span>).","next":"BDB, חֵק","prev":"BDB, חֲצֹצְרָה"}